WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:02.701
(playful music)

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:05.670
- Are you free for dinner tonight?

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.621
Alright.

00:00:06.621 --> 00:00:09.983
(phone falls)
(screaming)

00:00:13.121 --> 00:00:15.367
(groaning)

00:00:17.069 --> 00:00:17.647
Dammit.

00:00:31.649 --> 00:00:32.121
Dammit!

00:00:37.752 --> 00:00:38.467
Nothing?

00:00:39.793 --> 00:00:41.907
Please God, work!

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:44.217
I dropped my phone in the toilet.

00:00:44.217 --> 00:00:46.013
Is anyone able to help me fix that?

00:00:46.013 --> 00:00:47.473
- Um, possibly.

00:00:47.473 --> 00:00:50.353
Water damage is very difficult to fix.

00:00:50.353 --> 00:00:53.373
But we can go upstairs and
talk to our technician.

00:00:53.373 --> 00:00:55.660
- You wanna get dinner
tomorrow night, are you free?

00:00:56.711 --> 00:00:57.775
(smash)
(yelling)

00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:00.231
Dammit!

00:01:03.751 --> 00:01:04.917
- He texted!

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:06.414
(touchpad clicking)

00:01:08.264 --> 00:01:10.047
(flushing)

